#!/bin/sh
# rusty's commit hook (#485). Activate once per clone with `make setup`.
# Kept under a second on purpose — formatting and the size gate only; the heavy
# checks (clippy, build, tests, deny) are `make gates`, run before readying a PR.
# CI re-runs everything, so `git commit --no-verify` is a safe escape hatch.
exec make --no-print-directory pre-commit
